# Local checkout of the game repository, if one is used for assets.
# Anchored to the root: an unanchored "game/" also matched public/game/, which is
# the WebAssembly build and does need to be committed.
/game/
/textures/
/build/

# The WebAssembly build is committed on purpose now: the launcher is served as static
# files from a CDN, so public/game/ has to be in the repository for the game to load.
# It was ignored back when a local server could reach outside the repo for it.
